    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been having this weird burning feeling in the middle of my chest lately. it usually happens when i'm doing something active like walking up the stairs at work, but then it goes away if i just stop and sit down for a minute. i'm thinking it's just really bad heartburn... should i just take some extra antacids to see if that clears it up?",
