      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the info. i mean, costochondritis sounds way more intense than this. it's really just like a warm, acidic feeling, you know? like when i ate that spicy pizza last night. i don't really want to deal with the hassle of a doctor's visit and the copay right now if it's just reflux. how many antacids can i safely take at once to really knock this out so i can get through my shift tomorrow?",
